Made every user-facing string in the add-on translatable. All labels, block and variation titles, schema field titles and descriptions, editor placeholders and carousel `aria-label`s now go through `react-intl` with stable message ids and English default messages, replacing the hardcoded Portuguese that had no catalogue behind it. Block and listing-variation titles are registered for extraction in `src/index.ts`, since Volto translates those through `formatMessageWithFallback` using the string itself as the id. The extraction yields 147 messages and the `pt_BR` catalogue is complete; `es` and `de` remain empty. @ericof
